@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Healthcare Portal

[*] --> Registration

state "Registration" as Registration
state "Failed Registration" as FailedRegistration
state "Signed In" as SignedIn
state "Access Denied" as AccessDenied
state "Facilities" as Facilities
state "News and Expert Content" as NewsAndExpertContent
state "Health Information" as HealthInformation
state "Result Viewed" as ResultViewed
state "Payment Process" as PaymentProcess
state "Insurance Validation" as InsuranceValidation
state "Doctor Consultation" as DoctorConsultation
state "Drug and Supplement Purchase" as DrugAndSupplementPurchase

Registration --> FailedRegistration : invalid registration details
FailedRegistration --> AccessDenied : access denied due to failed registration

SignedIn --> Facilities : user signed in successfully
Facilities --> NewsAndExpertContent : user accessed facilities
NewsAndExpertContent --> HealthInformation : user viewed news and expert content
HealthInformation --> ResultViewed : user checked symptoms or fitness checking options

ResultViewed --> PaymentProcess : user continued using the system
PaymentProcess --> InsuranceValidation : insurance validation for available finance-related services
InsuranceValidation --> DoctorConsultation : doctor consultation payment with insurance check
DoctorConsultation --> DrugAndSupplementPurchase : drug and supplement purchase with selected payment method (cash or insurance)

DrugAndSupplementPurchase --> PaymentProcess : user completed the payment process

PaymentProcess --> CollectFeedback : user collected feedback after service completion
CollectFeedback --> Logout : user logged out at the end of their session

AccessDenied --> [*] : access denied due to failed registration
FailedRegistration --> AccessDenied : access denied due to failed registration

@enduml
